# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo and on checkout, regardless of a
# developer's local core.autocrlf - this repo's tooling (prettier, cargo fmt)
# expects LF and a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true otherwise produces
# CRLF working-tree files that fail every format check, even on files nobody
# touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.otf binary
